HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0092.fits, spectra0093.fits,          HISTORY spectra0094.fits, spectra0095.fits, spectra0096.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0097.fits, spectra0098.fits, spectra0099.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0100.fits, spectra0101.fits were combined using a robust         HISTORY weighted mean with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1                  HISTORY modifications: The scale factors were determined using order 1          HISTORY and are: 0.8118432917781074, 0.8673306293686983,                        HISTORY 0.9490553960870353, 0.9844479878838909, 1.0036816181290458,             HISTORY 1.1609958011098886, 0.9963452923468586, 1.1008810709131953,             HISTORY 1.0487179678727552, 1.059895970633806.                                  END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             